              "blocks": {
                "text": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Wash cold, use a mild detergent, and dry in the shade rather than direct sun — this keeps hand-applied colour settling in rather than fading out. Avoid bleach and harsh spin cycles; block-printed cotton is meant to soften with age, not wear thin.</p>"
